#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059500 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb13e9d9-19f0-5f39-b9f8-e6e2f8fac433" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Coefficient Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/id #uuid "b2196eb1-6691-549b-950a-a9bab6863a70" :question/math-academy-id "e-4683" :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n${x - 2y = 1; 2y =-1$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\nx - 2y = 1; 0x + 2y =-1\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack \\matrix {1 & -2 \\ 0 & 2} \\right\\rbrack\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059501 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/id #uuid "b5967dd6-bdf9-5cd0-9639-ec2816d04256" :question/math-academy-id "e-4684" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n${y + x - 5 - 3z = 0; z = y + 7x; y + 3 - 2z = 1 - 2x$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\nx + y - 3z = 5; - 7x - y + z = 0; 2x + y - 2z =-2\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack \\matrix {1 & 1 & -3 \\ -7 & -1 & 1 \\ 2 & 1 & -2} \\right\\rbrack\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -7 & -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059502 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/id #uuid "05942b5f-c165-59c6-8b67-24bc8dd40cca" :question/math-academy-id "e-4685" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -4 & -12 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y$, then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n5x - 4y =-12; 3x + y = 1\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059503 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a Linear System With Variables Other Than x, y, z"}] :question/id #uuid "161a4327-2356-5779-92a6-8495cfffefb9" :question/math-academy-id "e-4686" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n${\\frac{c}{2} = a; 5 + 3b - a = 4c; d = 1$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n-a + 0b + \\frac{1}{2}c + 0d = 0; - a + 3b - 4c + 0d =-5; 0a + 0b + 0c + d = 1\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059894 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "83e807b6-d6f8-53f2-b115-1555aaea5385" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056085} {:answer/id #uuid "ae54720c-02af-5ca7-b71b-3c75b5a90136" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056086} {:answer/id #uuid "1ab34e8e-21db-58cb-8dc4-3e389fe78a23" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056087} {:answer/id #uuid "41e06a81-0005-590b-aa27-1ec77ffb049c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056088} {:answer/id #uuid "430d1419-4e3f-5ff1-b941-7460daceb94d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056089}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "430d1419-4e3f-5ff1-b941-7460daceb94d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056089} :answer-field/id #uuid "e858ca63-042d-53ac-84e0-bf30a158feac" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056084}] :question/id #uuid "fc7baee7-708d-5083-9b3d-6efab5143302" :question/math-academy-id "q-1051" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n${6x + y + z = 4; x + z = 9$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060122 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-